# Chat Autocomplete — Command Sources

Context: adding `/` command menu to chat composer (stream-json transport). Skills shipped as v1. This table tracks remaining sources + built-ins to layer on.

## Sources

| #   | Cmd                       | Source                                                             | Impl in chat                                                    | ROI        |
| --- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |
| 1   | **skills**                | `<cwd>/.claude/skills`, `<cwd>/.agents/skills`, `~/.claude/skills` | done                                                            | ✓          |
| 2   | **custom cmds** `/<name>` | `<cwd>/.claude/commands`, `~/.claude/commands`                     | fs scan + inject md body as user msg                            | high       |
| 3   | **agents** `/agents`      | `<cwd>/.claude/agents`, `~/.claude/agents`                         | fs scan, inject "use X agent"                                   | high       |
| 4   | `@file`                   | glob cwd + respect `.gitignore`                                    | new `@` hook, debounced fs search                               | high       |
| 5   | **/clear**                | built-in                                                           | kill chat session + reset timeline                              | high       |
| 6   | **/help**                 | built-in                                                           | static text response                                            | low effort |
| 7   | **/status**               | built-in                                                           | render `state` (model, sessionId, cwd, turn count)              | low effort |
| 11  | **/permissions**          | built-in                                                           | open settings → permissions tab                                 | low effort |
| 12  | **/hooks**                | built-in                                                           | open settings → hooks tab                                       | low effort |

